WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.760
Hey, David, at this point in time, what can change&nbsp;
the presidential race? So I'm gonna answer this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:11.760
question without weighing in on whether the race&nbsp;
is over it, because it doesn't. We've talked about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.160
the poll. The national polls look very good for&nbsp;
Biden. But Biden is not doing quite as well in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.720
Wisconsin, Michigan and Pennsylvania compared to&nbsp;
where Hillary was at this point four years ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:27.520
Whatever each of us believes to be the situation&nbsp;
right now, the question is what could dramatically&nbsp;&nbsp;

