change it? I think that at this point in time, we&nbsp;
really are looking only at big, big issues like a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.440
health issue for one of the candidates. If one of&nbsp;
the candidates were to be truly very ill, where it&nbsp;&nbsp;

