I mean by a major credible. Trump hasn't even&nbsp;
said what crime was committed, supposedly when he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:11.840
says that. But like a real story that takes over&nbsp;
about, wow, Trump or Biden accused of X, Y or Z.&nbsp;&nbsp;

