Remember many of the sexual assault&nbsp;
allegations against Biden, sorry against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:26.320
Trump were certainly crimes at the time. And you&nbsp;
can talk about statute of limitations or whatever.&nbsp;&nbsp;

