00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:49.280
impact. I know his his core base might not care,&nbsp;
but there are people who are just slightly over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:54.640
on the Trump side who know if Trump starts calling&nbsp;
black people the N-word, for example, or a Jews,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:59.360
the K word or something. I think that that that&nbsp;
would have an impact. Some people have written&nbsp;&nbsp;

